{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the following content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first 5 levels from the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All game modes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;When Man settled in Babylon they set on building a tower so high, they could reach the heavens. But the Lord will not be mocked! The Lord confused their language and scattered them over the face of the whole earth. But Man could not be stopped. Man started building new towers \u0430ll over earth...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retell the greatest tale of them all and reach the heavens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909650/extras/f21b177bcb909dda76b02bf58c6eeeb3.avif?t=1754233568\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story mode - pass all available levels from the story earning stars and high-scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless mode - play any unlocked level until you reach the top trying to beat your last high-score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Duel - play against a friend in a local split-screen match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sprint - play a sequence of 5 levels without stopping earning highest score you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Marathon - play a sequence of 10 levels without stopping earning highest score you can.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909650?t=1754233568","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909650?t=1754233568","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909650/59369b15b2e561536bb24ab2c7146